'''Throkk's Command''' can be found in [[Blackrock Coffer]].

==As a quest objective==
* {{questlong|Alliance|34|Covering All Possibilities}}

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
These weak humans are pathetic, barely worth the effort! Their measly defenses were easily destroyed by the [[Blackrock clan|Blackrock]]'s mighty power. Now with [[Northridge Point|this watchtower]] in our control, our assault on the occupied quarry can begin. [[Rend Blackhand|Our warchief]] demands us to crush the infantile minions of Ragnaros and establish a foothold in these lands to ultimately snuff out their lives beneath our feet.
----
[[Shuni Steeltooth|Shuni]], fortify your position on the watchtower and crush any foolish enough to mount an attack. Leave no survivors, the might of Blackrock knows no mercy!
}}

